  "schema:name": "Health Facility Registry",
  "schema:description": "The Health Facility Registry is the national authoritative source of identity, location, and classification data for all facilities, locations, and organisations through which health services are delivered or that are of direct relevance to the Ministry of Health’s mandate.",
